frac{\\pi}{8}$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)&=\\cos\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\\\&=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep the outside factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\right)&=\\frac{3}{5}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "775f9731-1544-5204-8de6-4690459bd627" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "775f9731-1544-5204-8de6-4690459bd627" :question/answer-fields "8643f37d-c1dc-5628-bcae-44f2b97e474f"] [:db/ensure "775f9731-1544-5204-8de6-4690459bd627" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087669 :knowledge-point/questions "775f9731-1544-5204-8de6-4690459bd627"] [:db/add "c3b49d0c-f73b-5094-9d9d-37348c69f198" :answer/id #uuid "c3b49d0c-f73b-5094-9d9d-37348c69f198"] [:db/add "c3b49d0c-f73b-5094-9d9d-37348c69f198" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c3b49d0c-f73b-5094-9d9d-37348c69f198" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\cos\\left(316^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "c3b49d0c-f73b-5094-9d9d-37348c69f198" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9adcabb4-04b4-52f9-b580-c0499f44e14b" :answer/id #uuid "9adcabb4-04b4-52f9-b580-c0499f44e14b"] [:db/add "9adcabb4-04b4-52f9-b580-c0499f44e14b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9adcabb4-04b4-52f9-b580-c0499f44e14b" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\cos\\left(158^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "9adcabb4-04b4-52f9-b580-c0499f44e14b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "321c9fe0-00d3-512d-a23d-8cb8529f167a" :answer/id #uuid "321c9fe0-00d3-512d-a23d-8cb8529f167a"] [:db/add "321c9fe0-00d3-512d-a23d-8cb8529f167a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "321c9fe0-00d3-512d-a23d-8cb8529f167a" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}\\cos\\left(158^\\circ\\right)"] [:db/ensure "321c9fe0-00d3-512d-a23d-8cb8529f167a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9068767c-1ed6-567b-8ec5-736662a8bd40" :answer/id #uuid "9068767c-1ed6-567b-8ec5-7366