e" :question/worked-solution "Collect the common factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&-\\frac{3}{4}\\sin^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)+\\frac{3}{4}\\cos^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\cos^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the cosine double-angle formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2 x-\\sin^2 x=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute $x=79^\\circ$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)&=\\cos\\left(2\\cdot 79^\\circ\\right)\\\\&=\\cos\\left(158^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep the outside factor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\cos^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(79^\\circ\\right)\\right)&=\\frac{3}{4}\\cos\\left(158^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "819b791c-f224-5d03-951f-ece7d94dc02e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "819b791c-f224-5d03-951f-ece7d94dc02e" :question/answer-fields "14d95057-ea6b-5312-8501-806da7aead97"] [:db/ensure "819b791c-f224-5d03-951f-ece7d94dc02e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087669 :knowledge-point/questions "819b791c-f224-5d03-951f-ece7d94dc02e"] [:db/add "057c5536-a3df-52cb-82f7-fb4080e8740a" :answer/id #uuid "057c5536-a3df-52cb-82f7-fb4080e8740a"] [:db/add "057c5536-a3df-52cb-82f7-fb4080e8740a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "057c5536-a3df-52cb-82f7-fb4080e8740a" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\cos\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{8}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "057c5536-a3df-52cb-82f7-fb4080e8740a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7683fcf-c6c6-58fb-ad0d-98cc8178bdf5" :answer/id #uuid "e7683fcf-c6c6-58fb-ad0d-98cc8178bdf5"] [:db/add "e7683fcf-c6c6-58fb-ad0d-98cc8178bdf5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e7683fcf-c6c6-58fb-ad0d-98cc8178bdf5" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\cos\\left(\\frac{15\\pi}{4}\\right)"] [:db/ensure "e7683fcf-c6c6-58fb-ad0d-98cc8178bdf5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ef55f71f-51c1-5ed2-b123-11c3097634fd" :answer/id #uuid "ef55f71f-51c1-5ed2-b123-11c3097634